[I] Asynchronous Name Service Library

[T] libasyncns is a C library for executing name service queries such as
[T] getaddrinfo and getnameinfo asynchronously. It runs the blocking libc
[T] resolver functions in worker processes or threads, offering an API
[T] similar to the synchronous calls.

[U] https://0pointer.de/lennart/projects/libasyncns/

[A] Libasyncns Authors
